      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is PROBLEM.\n\n72hz HMD cannot show all of 90fps frames, so lot of frame dropped. It's a waste of computing resources. \n\nAnd I feel slow downing or accelerating effect sometimes.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
