      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{64873f159cf028090ce2c2e2|full_name}: ALVR can do it. I don't mind 72hz (I just prefer 60Hz because of the stupid FiexedTimesteps settings.).\n\n...Now, to get to the point, running SteamVR as administrator seems to have fixed the issue.\n\nIt's strange, but I think it's okay for now.\n\nI'm still extremely worried about not being able to explicitly adjust FPS in VR. As creator(Need debug way).",
